Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part A}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.11,0:00:11.87,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,So in the end, \N who {\i1}did{\i0} take the offerings...?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.78,0:00:16.54,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,{\t(3153,3653,\3c&HFFFFFF&)}Those footprints weren’t \N Kamitsuorochi’s, after all...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.54,0:00:19.58,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,And who would’ve \N smashed the oni masks...?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.58,0:00:22.71,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Eh, who cares at this point? \N You worry too much.{It's all fine at this point, isn't it? You're concerning yourselves too much.}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.71,0:00:24.30,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Besides, there’s a {\i1}festival!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.30,0:00:25.05,Main,Ikirinko,0,0,0,,Liko!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.05,0:00:25.80,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.17,0:00:27.55,Main,Ikirinko,0,0,0,,Liko!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.84,0:00:30.30,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Ikirinko?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.47,0:00:37.06,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Grandma?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.60,0:00:39.98,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,Liko! It’s sure been a while!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.98,0:00:41.60,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,What brings you to Kitakami?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.60,0:00:43.69,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,Well, it {\i1}is{\i0} festival time. {It’s festival time, after all.}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.69,0:00:46.44,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,So I brought Momowarou back \N to visit its hometown.
Comment: 0,0:00:49.45,0:00:49.45,Main,,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:19.54,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part B}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.06,0:02:42.39,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I’m Navi! And this’s Metamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.18,0:02:45.44,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,Ooh, how cute!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.44,0:02:47.86,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,She’s a new friend of ours.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.86,0:02:51.03,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,I’m Diana, Liko’s grandma.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.03,0:02:53.69,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,These are Ikirinko and Momowarou.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.69,0:02:55.20,Main,Ikirinko,0,0,0,,Navi!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.91,0:03:00.20,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,That jinbei really looks great on you!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.20,0:03:02.08,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Doesn’t it? Thanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.08,0:03:05.04,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,You remind me of Liko \N when she was little.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.46,0:03:08.58,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,Oh, I know! I’ve got candies...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.00,0:03:10.71,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,Which one would you like?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.71,0:03:13.84,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ooh... Which one should I have...?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.30,0:03:16.97,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,Momowarou, you hold on a sec!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.10,0:03:26.56,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,There’s sour ones in there, \N so choose carefully.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.56,0:03:27.98,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Whaaa...?{Huh?}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.00,0:04:34.88,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,Look, you’ve got some sauce on you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.88,0:04:36.92,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Thanks, Grandma.{おばあちゃん}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.26,0:04:46.89,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That tasted great!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.27,0:04:51.15,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,I wonder where Momowarou’s \N gone off to.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.52,0:04:54.77,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,I went and got it a treat, \N but it’s already gone cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.77,0:04:57.49,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Maybe it went to see some friends?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.11,0:04:59.61,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,Friends?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.95,0:05:03.91,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,I’ll go look for it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.91,0:05:06.70,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,You two can go enjoy the festival.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.70,0:05:07.95,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.95,0:05:09.41,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Let’s go, Liko!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.41,0:05:10.21,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.21,0:06:00.59,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Delish!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.10,0:06:11.31,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hey, what’re these masks of?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.31,0:06:12.77,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Yeah, I wonder...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.77,0:06:14.52,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Hrm...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.90,0:06:16.86,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Those are the Comraddies!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.86,0:06:18.23,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,The Comraddies?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.23,0:06:22.82,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,The three Pokémon known as \N Iine'inu, Mashimashira, and Kichikigisu.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.82,0:06:26.99,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,They were the stars of the festival, \N as the heroes who defeated the oni.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.99,0:06:28.70,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,The stars!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.70,0:06:32.62,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,But then we learned they were bad, \N so we scolded them!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.62,0:06:34.00,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Aww...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.00,0:06:37.25,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Legends don’t always \N turn out to be true, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.25,0:06:39.13,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,You’re right there.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.50,0:06:41.63,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Now, let’s continue our showdown!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.01,0:06:44.30,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Forget that...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.30,0:06:46.39,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,What?! Running away, are ya?!{Do you intend on running away?}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.85,0:06:51.22,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Doesn’t something seem odd?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.87,0:07:12.75,Main,Kid,0,0,0,,Wah!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.75,0:07:13.91,Main,Kid,0,0,0,,What? What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.91,0:07:14.87,Main,Kid,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.25,0:07:15.87,Main,Kid,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.87,0:07:16.58,Main,Kid,0,0,0,,Wah!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.80,0:07:24.51,Main,Vendor,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.47,0:07:29.60,Main,Kid,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.14,0:07:31.56,Main,Kid,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.56,0:07:32.77,Main,Kid,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.77,0:07:34.77,Main,Vendor,0,0,0,,Watch out, all of you!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.44,0:07:41.69,Main,Vendor,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.69,0:07:42.27,Main,Vendor,0,0,0,,Ah...
Comment: 10,0:07:42.73,0:07:44.28,Main,Vendor,0,0,0,,Ahhh!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.76,0:08:14.39,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Those are the Comraddies!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.31,0:08:16.18,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.19,0:08:25.23,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.32,0:08:34.79,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,They’re the Comraddies?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.79,0:08:40.62,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Iine'inu, Mashimashira, Kichikigisu. \N So you haven’t learned your lesson!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.62,0:08:42.71,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,You’ve made a mess of the festival!{PV}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.71,0:08:45.25,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,And everyone was \N really looking forward to it!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.72,0:08:53.89,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Looks like they’re ready to fight!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.89,0:08:55.39,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Be careful, everyone!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.72,0:08:58.52,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Let’s go, Yabasocha!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.86,0:09:06.44,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Wh-Where are they going?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.44,0:09:07.82,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,You’re not getting away!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.20,0:09:11.16,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.41,0:09:15.74,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What’s wrong, Yamirami?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.74,0:09:16.83,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wanival!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.00,0:09:24.04,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,This guy’s gonna be brutal...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.04,0:09:25.63,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.48,0:09:44.61,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,That’s Mind Power.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.90,0:09:47.11,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.11,0:09:49.11,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,It’s too dark to see.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.24,0:09:51.86,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Dodge it!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.87,0:09:57.99,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Masquernya, return!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.49,0:09:59.50,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Brimuon!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.12,0:10:05.50,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Loudbone, switch out for Lucario!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.76,0:10:13.76,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Sense its presence, Lucario!{Sense the foe's presence, Lucario!}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.76,0:10:19.18,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Brimuon, can you tell where it is?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.65,0:10:28.11,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Psycho Cutter!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.07,0:10:34.82,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,There! One more time!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.76,0:10:57.26,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Pull it together, Yamirami!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.26,0:10:58.47,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wanival...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.18,0:11:03.39,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Return, Wanival!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.39,0:11:04.52,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yamirami!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.90,0:11:13.32,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Counting on you, Surfugo!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.83,0:11:26.96,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It looks kinda mad...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.96,0:11:29.71,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,‘Cause someone with \N even {\i1}flashier{\i0} style showed up?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.72,0:11:40.64,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What’s it starin’ at...?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.56,0:11:50.15,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Then we can join in!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.15,0:11:55.78,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Break past your max \N with outrageous power!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.79,0:12:05.08,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Mega Evolve!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.02,0:12:30.52,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.52,0:12:33.52,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It’s too self-absorbed!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.52,0:12:35.23,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Good job working that out!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.23,0:12:36.44,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,No sweat!{maa na, I suppose so, it was nothing too special, eh I guess, downplaying his part (though still taking credit for it)}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.44,0:12:38.53,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Surfugo! Gold Rush!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.16,0:12:48.04,Main,Dot Ult,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.04,0:12:52.04,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Dodge it!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.26,0:12:58.63,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Whisk-Whisk Cannon!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.14,0:13:10.14,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,{\q2}What’s {\i1}with{\i0} this thing...? \N Despite how huge it is, there’s {\i1}no{\i0} gap in its defenses!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.14,0:13:11.85,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,If you need a gap...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.85,0:13:14.15,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon! Transform into that guy!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.38,0:13:35.13,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,That’s Strength Sap!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.13,0:13:36.88,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Not bad, Seille!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.67,0:13:44.55,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,Momowarou, where are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.55,0:13:47.14,Main,Ikirinko,0,0,0,,Momowarou! Momowarou!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.56,0:13:51.06,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,What was that...?
Comment: 0,0:14:01.45,0:14:01.45,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part C}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.82,0:14:09.55,Main,Person,0,0,0,,What is all this?{nanikore}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.55,0:14:10.87,Main,Person,0,0,0,,How could this happen? \N How am I...?{sonna, dou su...}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.59,0:14:23.09,Main,Person,0,0,0,,Just what {\i1}was{\i0} all that...?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.90,0:14:38.90,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Utter victory!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.65,0:14:45.41,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,So those footprints \N came from these guys.{The footprints were theirs after all.}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.41,0:14:47.83,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Quit your mischief-making for good!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.83,0:14:50.49,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yeah, give it up already!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.13,0:15:01.05,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What’s it doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.05,0:15:02.55,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Flattery! It’s plotting something!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.76,0:15:07.18,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Whoa, what is this?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.18,0:15:08.60,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I can’t see a thing!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.60,0:15:10.06,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Get back for now!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.14,0:15:13.18,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,That was close! Run for it!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.18,0:15:15.19,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,They still want to go on a rampage?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.19,0:15:16.90,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,They never learn.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.78,0:15:24.90,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ogrepon!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.10,0:15:53.22,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Amazing...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.19,0:15:59.90,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,You’re not getting away!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.69,0:16:05.94,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ogrepon’s mad...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.94,0:16:08.70,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Because the Comraddies \N wrecked the festival.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.39,0:16:35.52,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Momowarou?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.39,0:16:42.27,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Why’s it siding with the Comraddies?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.27,0:16:45.90,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,Momowarou used to be \N the Comraddies’ boss.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:45.90,0:16:47.36,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Their boss?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.36,0:16:51.49,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Which led to it fighting Ogrepon \N and getting thrashed.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.49,0:16:53.28,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,I had no idea...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.28,0:16:57.79,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,Momowarou... \N Are you trying to save your old friends?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.05,0:17:11.43,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,I’ll observe this battle \N to the very end.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.43,0:17:14.30,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Ooh, a 1v1 all-out battle!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.30,0:17:16.56,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,This has really gone off the rails.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.03,0:17:32.95,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Terastal?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.06,0:18:06.44,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,Momowarou!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.66,0:18:18.70,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,You tried your best \N for your friends, didn’t you?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.84,0:18:32.38,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,Ogrepon, sorry for the trouble.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.52,0:18:49.61,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} three!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.44,0:18:56.45,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,{\q2}You weren’t thinking you could \N wreck the festival and get off scot-free, were you?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.59,0:19:15.13,Main,Vendor,0,0,0,,Ooh, you’re strong!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.97,0:19:24.35,Main,Vendor,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.35,0:19:26.02,Main,Vendor,0,0,0,,Put some more into it!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.37,0:19:42.87,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,Here, you should eat something too!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.87,0:19:45.83,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,A meal after some hard work \N always hits just right!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.13,0:19:51.59,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,Starting now, what say you come \N enjoy the festival with the rest of us?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.26,0:20:02.60,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hey... The Comraddies used to get lotsa offerings \N and play with everyone, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.60,0:20:03.89,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Seems like it.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.89,0:20:06.89,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,So maybe they wanted some attention.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.31,0:20:11.90,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,If someone you love ignores you, \N you feel really lonely.{If you can't make the person(s) you love give you any attention, it makes you feel really lonely, after all.}{Hmm where did that come from, Navi?}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.61,0:20:13.90,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,You’re right about that!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.79,0:20:30.92,Main,Shizune,0,0,0,,Um... Thank you so much \N for saving the festival.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.92,0:20:32.75,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,I-It’s no big deal...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.75,0:20:34.80,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,That’s that taken care of, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.92,0:20:38.84,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Delish!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.35,0:20:47.77,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,You’re leaving?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.77,0:20:49.31,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Say hi{ to that person} for me, won’t you?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.36,0:21:03.83,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Here. A souvenir for you, Grandma.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.83,0:21:05.83,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I’ve been wanting \N to give it to you for ages.{~~You made me go back to the ship to go get this~~}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.83,0:21:08.83,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,Oh, what a cute Ikirinko!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.83,0:21:11.29,Main,Ikirinko,0,0,0,,Cute Ikirinko!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.29,0:21:14.00,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,Looks like Ikirinko likes it too.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.00,0:21:16.34,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,Thank you. I’ll treasure it.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.17,0:21:21.01,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Sorry, Momowarou. \N I don’t have one of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.47,0:21:24.43,Main,Diana,0,0,0,,And there you go again...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.43,0:21:26.39,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Then I’ll give you something nice!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.97,0:21:28.98,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Bam!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.15,0:21:37.48,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Did I scare ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:39.49,0:21:40.99,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.99,0:21:42.61,Main,Navi,200,0,0,,You can have this.
Comment: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie A}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.62,0:21:48.25,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Friede here!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.25,0:21:51.92,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It’s time to Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.00,0:21:55.17,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Today’s topic is Momowarou!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.17,0:21:59.67,Main,Friede,0,0,20,,It can control people and Pokémon \N by having them eat a certain something,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:59.67,0:22:02.34,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,but do you know what that thing is?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.22,0:22:06.47,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,See the answer after the commercials!
Comment: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:06.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{Ending}
Comment: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:36.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie B}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.40,0:23:42.32,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Time to announce \N the correct answer!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.32,0:23:43.86,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The answer is...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.86,0:23:45.49,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,A: Mochi!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.82,0:23:50.74,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,{\q2}It controls anyone who eats its poisonous mochi \N with chains. Make sure you don’t eat any!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:50.74,0:23:52.54,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What should I try next?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:52.54,0:23:53.24,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:54.00,0:23:54.87,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:54.87,0:23:56.37,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Wait! If you eat that—
Dialogue: 10,0:23:56.37,0:23:57.37,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Kibi-kibi!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:57.37,0:24:00.50,Main,Seille,0,0,0,,Kibi-kibi kibi-kibi kibi-kibi...
Comment: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:01.67,0:24:04.01,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Orange Academy’s {\i1}huge!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:05.01,0:24:07.97,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,The school festival’s \N mega-packed with people!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:07.97,0:24:09.59,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,I’ll finally get to see Nemo again! {I’ll get to see Nemo for the first time in ages!}{cps crushing... -ed}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:09.59,0:24:12.18,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Botan says she wants to \N introduce her friends!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.18,0:24:13.56,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Hey, you lot.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:13.56,0:24:14.85,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Ms. Raifort!{sensei}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:14.85,0:24:18.02,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,I’d like to entrust you \N with an important investigation. You in?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.02,0:24:18.77,Main,Kids,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.77,0:24:22.15,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And so, to be continued \N next time on Pocket Monsters!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:22.15,0:24:24.57,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Paldea in Calamity ―Revival
Dialogue: 10,0:24:24.57,0:24:26.15,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,What’s a “calamity”?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:26.15,0:24:28.49,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Navi gets to be in a parade!
