Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.21,0:22:36.21,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Getting attached, but then they turn away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.21,0:22:39.46,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}When things just don’t go the way that you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:42.84,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Isn’t it so fun? Doesn’t it make your heart race?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.84,0:22:45.97,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Doesn’t it make you all excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.97,0:22:47.68,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}When I feel a spark...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.68,0:22:51.10,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}I’ll catch it in a Cutesy Capsule
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.10,0:22:54.48,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Face to face with the dream I’ve always imagined...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.48,0:22:55.98,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}I’ve got electric jolts running through me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.98,0:22:57.73,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}I’m so lovey-dovey I can’t even move!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.73,0:23:01.11,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}When I know change is still inside of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.11,0:23:04.11,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}I’ll catch it in a Cutesy Capsule
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.11,0:23:07.62,ED,,0,0,0,,{\q2\blur5\pos(960,22)\bord9\shad0\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&}then we can be together forever
